    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to talk to people. they always tell me \"it gets better\" or \"stay strong\" but they don't get it. they don't see what i see every day. it's just this endless, heavy nothingness. i feel like i've already died, like i'm just a shadow following him around until he's gone too. i'm just waiting for the silence.",
